            <ArticleTitle>Slipped capital femoral epiphysis and hypothyroidism in a patient with Down syndrome.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>35-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Early screening is key for patients, such as those with Down syndrome, at high risk for associated diseases. Slipped capital femoral epiphysis and hypothyroidism require a high level of suspicion, screening, and early referral to avoid long-term complications.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
